 * leaves the rest of the preset empty so it can be merged with inline values on a future run. -
 * PRESET_SAVE_SECTION_CANDIDATE: Candidate model identity (`candidate_model_uuid`,
 * `candidate_model_source`, `candidate_model_name`) and the non-prompt inference params
 * (`max_tokens`,…
