/**
 * Lifecycle status of a scenario set. Uploaded sets are created as ready. Generated sets start as
 * generating and then become ready, failed, or cancelled. - SCENARIO_SET_STATUS_GENERATING:
 * Generation is in progress. The scenarios are not ready yet. - SCENARIO_SET_STATUS_READY: The
 * scenario set is ready to use. - SCENARIO_SET_STATUS_FAILED: Generation failed. The scenario set
 * has no readable scenarios. - SCENARIO_SET_STATUS_CANCELLED: Generation was cancelled before
